# Blaze Flow maintenance schedule, run by supercronic in the `scheduler` service.
# Times are UTC (the container clock). Output goes to the container log.
#
# Not scheduled on purpose:
#   check_operational_alerts  needs --workspace-id; run per workspace by hand or from a monitor.
#   requeue_dead_letters      only after the delivery problem is fixed (manual).

# Abandoned direct-to-R2 uploads: abort and release quota reservations.
*/30 * * * * python manage.py expire_direct_uploads
# Downgrade lapsed PRO subscriptions.
15 2 * * * python manage.py process_expired_subscriptions
# Expired password-reset / email-verification tokens.
30 2 * * * python manage.py purge_auth_tokens
# Physically delete soft-deleted review attachments past REVIEW_FILE_RETENTION_DAYS.
45 2 * * * python manage.py purge_review_files
